WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:04.754
To find her way

00:00:04.754 --> 00:00:09.592
back to the gravel beds
where she was born.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:17.225
This mom to be has an amazing memory,
following sights and smells

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.645
logged in her brain
when she first swam out to sea.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.614
Where there's a fork in the river

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.993
She knows exactly

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.996
which way to turn.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.918
She's on track.

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:46.296
But unfortunately for her,

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:50.508
her spawning grounds lie above a 30 mile

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:59.476
gantlet, fast flowing rapids,

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.937
vicious whirlpools and towering

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:06.441
waterfalls.

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:14.824
But she's

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:18.828
no ordinary fish.

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:31.174
She can lead the human equivalent

00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:35.970
of a four story building,

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:44.145
but she's got to do it again

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:49.317
and again.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:54.114
Halfway

00:01:54.114 --> 00:02:01.329
there,

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:04.332
she's exhausted.

00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:10.755
She's not just fighting

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:13.341
the current.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.806
No longer feeding 

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:23.810
many salmon are already wasting away.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.522
Precious energy used up,

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.192
morphing their bodies ready to breed.

00:02:35.071 --> 00:02:37.115
Some years

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:41.536
90% don't make it to spawn.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:48.960
Only the toughest moms
to be have enough in the tank

00:02:49.752 --> 00:02:52.380
for one final giant hurdle.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:22.869
She can only jump halfway,

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:27.332
but thrashing her tail, she can power up

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:29.709
the final few feet

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:37.884
and over the lip of the floor.

00:03:42.305 --> 00:03:45.683
Just a few more miles to go.

